ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitRecruitNT = 新兵連身工作服 | recruit jumpsuit
    .desc = 一款配有藍色滾邊的優雅灰色連身工作服，非常適合氣質端莊的助手。 | A classy grey jumpsuit with blue trims. Perfect for the dignified helper.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitRecruitSyndie = 黑幫招募連身衣 | syndicate recruit jumpsuit
    .desc = 一套令人起疑的深灰色連身工作服。彷彿乘客們還不夠心存疑慮似的。 | A dubious, dark-grey jumpsuit. As if passengers weren't dubious enough already.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitRepairmanNT = 維修工連身工作服 | repairman jumpsuit
    .desc = 這件連身工作服會讓你聯想到某個船員部門的工作崗位。但願你不必像那些怪胎一樣做同樣的工作。 | A jumpsuit that reminds you of a certain crew-sector work position. Hopefully, you won't have to do the same job as THOSE freaks.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitRepairmanSyndie = 黑幫維修工連身工作服 | syndicate repairman jumpsuit
    .desc = 實用、時尚又酷勁十足。Nanotrasen 的工程師們都希望自己也能像這件單品一樣帥氣。 | Functional, fashionable, and badass. Nanotrasen's engineers wish they could look as good as this.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitParamedicSyndie = 「辛迪加」救護員連身工作服 | syndicate paramedic jumpsuit
    .desc = 不知為何，穿上這件衣服會讓人覺得自己似乎快要違反《日內瓦公約》了。 | For some reason, wearing this makes you feel like you're awfully close to violating the Geneva Convention.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpsuitChiefEngineerSyndie = 辛迪加總工程師連身工作服 | syndicate chief engineer jumpsuit
    .desc = 一套看起來很邪惡的連身工作服，搭配反光背心和紅色背心。
